title: 'feat[FRAME]: Implement VersionedCall for pallets storing calls to prevent
  execution with changed semantics'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    fixes https://github.com/paritytech/polkadot-sdk/issues/1138

    This PR implements `VersionedCall` support across all pallets that store calls (Scheduler, Multisig, Lottery, Collective, and Democracy) to prevent the execution of stored calls when runtime upgrades change call semantics.
